  action shows the `**/coverage.cobertura.xml` pattern. That pattern matching
  only one directory level meant the documented configuration could never find
  a coverlet report at all: the action's glob loop had no `shopt -s globstar`,
  so `**` behaved as `*`, and nothing ever ran the pattern to notice.

  Keep the directory depth. Flattening it makes the ci.yml coverage-action job
  pass with or without globstar, which is the same as deleting the test.
-->
